  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>24</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cot</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>24</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><m